@page "/kildeutforsker"
@using Fhi.Munin.Explorer.Blazor

<PageTitle>Modern host — kildeutforskeren</PageTitle>

<div class="hostchrome">
    <p class="hostchrome-note">
        <code>KildeExplorer</code>, the whole kildeutforsker, as a host that would rather not own
        the address bar mounts it. <a href="/kilder">The kilder page</a> mounts the bare
        <code>KildeSearch</code> behind a wrapper of its own instead. This page is here so the state
        gate drives the browser's Back and Forward through the component's own history entries
        (Fhi.Metadata-l9l2n.124), which the wrapper there would answer for it.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="hostframe">
    <KildeExplorer Language="no"
                   VariableExplorerPath="/utforsker"
                   @rendermode="@(new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false))" />
</div>
